<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Formless macro LOCKED</Major>
    <Description>180 formless macro for the game "LOCKED" this will turn your camera 180 degress and then do the form animation for you all you have to do is look slightly up and it will work, NOTE: the resolution for this to work is 1920 by 1080 ALSO make sure you are shift locked! Enjoy !</Description>
